# Agent orchestration index

Subagents live in **`.cursor/agents/`**. **Parent** runs the loop per `.cursor/rules/orchestration.mdc`.

| Subagent | When |
|----------|------|
| **planner** | Before generator — issue spec + rubric |
| **architect** | Stack, ADR drafts, unresolved forks |
| **generator** | Implement issue spec; TDD; `generator-state.md` |
| **code-reviewer** | Substantive code; flags missing ADR |
| **api-reviewer** | HTTP/API route handlers |
| **mcp-reviewer** | MCP tools, schemas, auth |
| **database-reviewer** | Migrations, SQL, RLS |
| **security-reviewer** | Auth, secrets, OWASP surfaces |
| **frontend-evaluator** | Live UI vs rubrics (Playwright MCP) |
| **performance-evaluator** | Perf budgets, Lighthouse |
| **doc-updater** | **After** all other required reviewers PASS |

All reviewers write to `docs/project/feedback/<issue>/<type>-i<iter>.md`.

Skills for depth: `.cursor/skills/README.md`